2.The Commission shall adopt implementing acts to establish and update the lists of third countries providing partner originating content. The Commission shall assess the implementation of the agreements referred to in paragraph 1, on the basis of the following criteria:
(a) whether the country grants national treatment to Union products and entities;
(b) risks related to security of supply or high-risk dependencies;
(c) any applicable exceptions under the relevant agreements;
(d) the level of openness of the country’s public procurement market;
(e) the existence of measures limiting access for Union operators or products;
(f) the comparability of regulatory frameworks, including on transparency, competition and sustainability;
(g) the existence of fair competition conditions;
(h) risks of circumvention of Article 11 requirements;
