The criterion relating to main electronic systems shall not apply to heavy-duty vehicles or electric non-road mobile machinery. The requirements set out in points (e) and (f) apply from [OP: please insert date three years after the date of entry into force of this Regulation]. The requirements set out in points (g) and (h) apply from [OP: please insert date five years after the date of entry into force of this Regulation].

